        <div style="text-align: justify; color: rgb(101, 102, 106); font-family: Arial; font-size: 10pt;">The following summary provides quick information for purposes of Nu Skin&#8217;s 2026 Annual Meeting. It does not contain all of the information provided
          elsewhere in the proxy statement; therefore, you should read the entire proxy statement carefully before voting. This proxy statement and form of proxy are first being sent or given to our stockholders on or about April 15, 2026.</div>

