                <div style="text-align: left; color: rgb(18, 115, 153); font-family: Arial; font-size: 10pt; font-weight: bold;">Director since 2025</div>
              </td>

    <td style="width: 69%; vertical-align: top;">
                <div style="text-align: left; color: rgb(101, 102, 106); font-family: Arial; font-size: 10pt;">Compensation and Human Capital Committee</div>
                <div style="text-align: left; color: rgb(101, 102, 106); font-family: Arial; font-size: 10pt;"> <br/>
                </div>
                <div style="text-align: left; color: rgb(101, 102, 106); font-family: Arial; font-size: 10pt;">Nominating and Corporate Governance Committee</div>
