                <div style="color: rgb(101, 102, 106); font-family: Arial; font-size: 10pt;">Overseeing our risk assessment and risk management programs and plans related to our major financial risk exposures; operational risks related to information
                  systems, information security and privacy; and public disclosure and investor-related risks; and</div>
