              </td>

    <td style="width: 18pt; vertical-align: top; color: rgb(101, 102, 106); font-family: Arial; font-size: 10pt;">&#8722;</td>

    <td style="width: auto; vertical-align: top; text-align: justify;">
                <div style="color: rgb(101, 102, 106); font-family: Arial; font-size: 10pt;">Overseeing our human capital management, including policies and strategies regarding recruiting, career development and progression, and inclusion practices; and</div>
              </td>

  </tr>


</table>
        <div>&#160;</div>

