        <div style="text-align: left; color: rgb(18, 115, 153); font-family: Arial; font-size: 12pt; font-weight: bold;"><a id="EXECUTIVECOMPENSATION"><!--Anchor--></a>EXECUTIVE COMPENSATION:</div>

        <div style="text-align: left; color: rgb(18, 115, 153); font-family: Arial; font-size: 12pt; font-weight: bold;">COMPENSATION DISCUSSION AND ANALYSIS</div>

        <div>
          <hr style="height: 1px; width: 100%; color: #000000; background-color: #000000; text-align: center; border: none; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;"/></div>

        <div style="text-align: justify; color: rgb(101, 102, 106); font-family: Arial; font-size: 10pt;">Our Compensation Discussion and Analysis (&#8220;CD&amp;A&#8221;) describes our executive compensation programs and compensation decisions in 2025 for our named
          executive officers (&#8220;NEOs&#8221;), who for 2025 were:</div>

        <div>&#160;</div>

