            <div><a href="#TABLEOFCONTENTS"><span style="font-style: italic; font-size: 8pt;">Table of Contents</span></a></div>

          </div>

        </div>

        <div style="text-align: justify; color: rgb(101, 102, 106); font-family: Arial; font-size: 10pt;">The following table describes the metrics upon which NEOs earn each component of target variable compensation.</div>

        <div>&#160;</div>

