                <div style="text-align: center; color: rgb(101, 102, 106); font-family: Arial; font-size: 10pt; font-style: italic;">Aligns management </div>
                <div style="text-align: center; color: rgb(101, 102, 106); font-family: Arial; font-size: 10pt; font-style: italic;">with</div>
                <div style="text-align: center; color: rgb(101, 102, 106); font-family: Arial; font-size: 10pt; font-style: italic;">stockholders&#8217; </div>
                <div style="text-align: center; color: rgb(101, 102, 106); font-family: Arial; font-size: 10pt; font-style: italic;">interests</div>
                <div style="text-align: center; color: rgb(101, 102, 106); font-family: Arial; font-size: 10pt; font-style: italic;">Promotes multi-year </div>
                <div style="text-align: center; color: rgb(101, 102, 106); font-family: Arial; font-size: 10pt; font-style: italic;">retention</div>
              </td>

    <td style="width: 27.07%; vertical-align: top; border-left: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0); border-right: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0);">
                <div style="text-align: center; color: rgb(101, 102, 106); font-family: Arial; font-size: 10pt; font-style: italic;">Aligns management with</div>
                <div style="text-align: center; color: rgb(101, 102, 106); font-family: Arial; font-size: 10pt; font-style: italic;">stockholders&#8217; interests</div>
                <div style="text-align: center; color: rgb(101, 102, 106); font-family: Arial; font-size: 10pt; font-style: italic;">Provides a balance to the </div>
                <div style="text-align: center; color: rgb(101, 102, 106); font-family: Arial; font-size: 10pt; font-style: italic;">top-line and operating-<br/>
                </div>
                <div style="text-align: center; color: rgb(101, 102, 106); font-family: Arial; font-size: 10pt; font-style: italic;">income metrics in the </div>
                <div style="text-align: center; color: rgb(101, 102, 106); font-family: Arial; font-size: 10pt; font-style: italic;">cash incentive bonus </div>
                <div style="text-align: center; color: rgb(101, 102, 106); font-family: Arial; font-size: 10pt; font-style: italic;">program</div>
              </td>

