        <div style="text-align: left; color: rgb(18, 115, 153); font-family: Arial; font-size: 11pt; font-style: italic;">Cash Incentive Bonuses</div>

        <div>&#160;</div>

        <div style="text-align: justify; color: rgb(101, 102, 106); font-family: Arial; font-size: 10pt;"><a id="OLE_LINK18"></a>For 2025, each of the NEOs participated in our Executive Cash Incentive Plan. This plan awards cash incentive bonuses based
          on achievement of financial goals&#8212;using the metrics of adjusted revenue and adjusted operating income&#8212;and strategic goals.</div>

        <div>&#160;</div>

        <div style="text-align: justify; font-family: Arial; font-size: 10pt;"><span style="font-size: 10pt; font-family: Arial; font-style: italic; color: rgb(18, 115, 153);">Target Bonus.</span><span style="font-size: 10pt; font-family: Arial; color: rgb(101, 102, 106);"> Cash incentive bonuses are computed based on the degree to which pre-determined goal performance levels are met or exceeded. If goal performance levels are met for a particular year, a participant will earn a bonus equal
            to a pre-established percentage of year-end base salary, the &#8220;target bonus.&#8221; We set the target bonus as a percentage of base salary based on an executive officer&#8217;s position and responsibility and on market practices.</span></div>

        <div>&#160;</div>

        <div style="text-align: justify; color: rgb(101, 102, 106); font-family: Arial; font-size: 10pt;">In addition to reviewing and adjusting our NEOs&#8217; base salaries as discussed above, the Committee also determined to reduce the CEO&#8217;s target bonus
          percentage by 10 percentage points, from 110% to 100%, for 2025. The following table provides the target bonus percentages (as a percentage of salary) for each of our NEOs in 2025.</div>

        <div>&#160;</div>

        <table cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" border="0" style="border-collapse: collapse; width: 60%; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Arial; font-size: 10pt; text-align: left; border-spacing: 0; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;">


  <tr>

    <td colspan="1" style="background-color: #007299; border-bottom: 1px solid #FFFFFF; vertical-align: bottom; width: 1%;">&#160;</td>

