                <div style="text-align: left; color: rgb(18, 115, 153); font-family: Arial; font-size: 10pt;">income</div>
              </td>

    <td style="width: 12.99%; vertical-align: top;">
                <div style="text-align: center; color: rgb(101, 102, 106); font-family: Arial; font-size: 10pt;">37.5%</div>
              </td>

    <td style="width: 30.64%; vertical-align: top;">
                <div style="text-align: left; color: rgb(101, 102, 106); font-family: Arial; font-size: 10pt;">Incentivize profitability and control of expenses</div>
