        <div style="text-align: justify; color: rgb(101, 102, 106); font-family: Arial; font-size: 10pt;">Our 2025 strategic goals consisted of the following three goals, each of which was weighted at 8.33%:</div>

        <div>&#160;</div>

        <table cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" style="font-family: Arial; font-size: 10pt; width: 100%; text-align: left; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); border-spacing: 0;" class="DSPFListTable">


  <tr>

    <td style="width: 18pt;"><br/>
              </td>

    <td style="width: 18pt; vertical-align: top; color: rgb(101, 102, 106); font-family: Arial; font-size: 10pt;">&#8722;</td>

    <td style="width: auto; vertical-align: top; text-align: justify;">
                <div style="font-family: Arial; font-size: 10pt;"><span style="font-size: 10pt; font-family: Arial; font-style: italic; color: rgb(18, 115, 153);">Adjusted Nu Skin gross margin.</span><span style="font-size: 10pt; font-family: Arial; color: rgb(101, 102, 106);"> Measured as gross profit as a percentage of revenue for our core Nu Skin business, calculated with the same methodology and adjustments described above for adjusted revenue and adjusted operating income.</span></div>
              </td>

  </tr>


</table>
        <div>&#160;</div>

        <table cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" style="font-family: Arial; font-size: 10pt; width: 100%; text-align: left; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); border-spacing: 0;" class="DSPFListTable">


