    <td style="width: auto; vertical-align: top; text-align: justify;">
                <div style="font-family: Arial; font-size: 10pt;"><span style="font-size: 10pt; font-family: Arial; font-style: italic; color: rgb(18, 115, 153);">Adjusted Rhyz revenue.</span><span style="font-size: 10pt; font-family: Arial; color: rgb(101, 102, 106);"> This goal refers to the revenue of our Rhyz strategic investment arm, calculated under the same methodology described above for the adjusted revenue metric.</span></div>
              </td>

  </tr>


</table>
        <div>&#160;</div>

        <div style="text-align: justify; color: rgb(101, 102, 106); font-family: Arial; font-size: 10pt;">Cash incentive bonuses under our Executive Cash Incentive Plan are based on annual performance results and are paid annually after the end of the
          year.</div>

        <div>&#160;</div>

        <div style="text-align: justify; font-family: Arial; font-size: 10pt;"><span style="font-size: 10pt; font-family: Arial; font-style: italic; color: rgb(18, 115, 153);">2025 Performance Levels, Achievement and Payout.</span><span style="font-size: 10pt; font-family: Arial; color: rgb(101, 102, 106);"> The following table sets forth the 2025 performance levels, actual performance, and achievement percentages, as well as the percentage of target bonus that was paid under the
            pre-established terms of the 2025 program.</span></div>

        <div>&#160;</div>

        <div>
          <table cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" border="0" style="font-family: Arial; font-size: 10pt; width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; text-align: left; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); border-spacing: 0;">


  <tr>

    <td colspan="1" style="vertical-align: bottom; background-color: rgb(0, 114, 153); width: 1%;">&#160;</td>

    <td colspan="6" style="vertical-align: bottom; background-color: rgb(0, 114, 153);">
                  <div style="text-align: left; color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-family: Arial; font-size: 10pt;">(dollar amounts in thousands)</div>
                </td>

    <td style="width: 11.44%; vertical-align: bottom; background-color: rgb(0, 114, 153);">&#160;</td>

  </tr>

  <tr>

    <td colspan="1" rowspan="2" style="background-color: rgb(0, 114, 153); border-top: 1px solid rgb(255, 255, 255); vertical-align: bottom; width: 1%;">&#160;</td>

    <td rowspan="2" style="background-color: rgb(0, 114, 153); border-right: 1px solid rgb(255, 255, 255); border-top: 1px solid rgb(255, 255, 255); vertical-align: bottom; width: 26%;">
                  <div style="text-align: center; color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-family: Arial; font-size: 9pt; font-weight: bold;">Metric</div>
                </td>

    <td colspan="3" style="background-color: rgb(0, 114, 153); border-right: 1px solid rgb(255, 255, 255); border-top: 1px solid rgb(255, 255, 255); vertical-align: bottom;">
