                  <div style="color: rgb(101, 102, 106); font-family: Arial; font-size: 9pt;">As compared to our 2025 reported revenue ($1,485,159), operating income ($65,763), Nu Skin gross margin (77.4%) and Nu Skin selling expense percentage (40.3%),
                    our 2025 adjusted amounts reflect adjustments for foreign-currency fluctuations and, in the case of adjusted operating income, restructuring and impairment charges and compensation-related expenses associated with the sale of our Mavely
                    business. Our Rhyz revenue does not include any adjustments for 2025.</div>
