<div>
        Overall, in 2025, our adjusted revenue and adjusted operating income results in our Executive Cash Incentive Plan fell below the minimum performance levels established at the beginning of the year. As a result, consistent with our commitment to pay
        for performance and the terms of the plan, the cash incentive awards associated with our financial goals were not earned. A payout percentage of 21.9% was earned based on partial achievement of our strategic goals.
        </div>
<div>&#160;</div>

