        <div style="text-align: justify; font-family: Arial; font-size: 10pt;"><span style="font-size: 10pt; font-family: Arial; font-style: italic; color: rgb(18, 115, 153);">Performance-Based Awards Granted in 2023&#8211;2025&#8212;Goals and Vesting.</span><span style="font-size: 10pt; font-family: Arial; color: rgb(101, 102, 106);"> Our performance-based equity awards in the past several years have generally been structured with three tranches, with vesting contingent on the achievement of adjusted
            EPS goals in the year of grant and in each of the two following years. The goals for all three of these one-year periods are set at the time of grant.</span></div>

        <div>&#160;</div>

        <div style="text-align: justify; color: rgb(101, 102, 106); font-family: Arial; font-size: 10pt;">Performance-based equity awards granted in 2023, 2024 and 2025 included tranches that were contingent on 2025 results. One of these three tranches
          ultimately paid out at 0%, and the other two were earned at varying degrees:</div>

        <div>&#160;</div>

        <table cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" border="0" style="border-collapse: collapse; width: 80%; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Arial; font-size: 10pt; text-align: left; border-spacing: 0; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;">


