        <div><span style="font-size: 9pt;"> </span></div>

        <div style="font-size: 9pt;">&#160;</div>

        <div style="text-align: justify; color: rgb(101, 102, 106); font-family: Arial; font-size: 10pt;">The table below summarizes the goals and achievement levels for performance-based equity awards granted in 2023&#8211;2025. For each of these awards, a
          target goal was set for the year of grant, and the subsequent years&#8217; goals require improvement over the prior years. As illustrated in the table, the goals for the 2025 awards are lower than those for the 2024 awards, which are lower than those
          for the 2023 awards. This reflects the headwinds across many of our markets, macroeconomic pressures impacting consumer spending and customer acquisition, and disruptions associated with the ongoing transformation of our business, which are
          factors in setting our budgets and goals for each year.</div>

        <div>&#160;</div>

        <div class="BRPFPageBreakArea" style="clear: both; margin-top: 10pt; margin-bottom: 10pt;">
          <div style="text-align: center;" class="BRPFPageNumberArea"><span style="font-family: Arial; font-size: 8pt; font-weight: normal; font-style: normal;">28</span></div>

          <div class="BRPFPageBreak" style="page-break-after: always;">
