    <td style="width: auto; vertical-align: top; text-align: justify;">
                <div style="color: rgb(101, 102, 106); font-family: Arial; font-size: 9pt;">As compared to our 2024 reported diluted EPS of $(2.95), our 2024 adjusted EPS reflects adjustments totaling $3.79 for restructuring and impairment charges, an
                  inventory write-off, and consulting fees associated with the sale of our Mavely business.</div>
              </td>

  </tr>


</table>
