    <td style="width: auto; vertical-align: top; text-align: justify;">
                <div style="color: rgb(101, 102, 106); font-family: Arial; font-size: 9pt;">As compared to our 2025 reported diluted EPS of $3.18, our 2025 adjusted EPS reflects adjustments totaling $(1.91) for the gain on the sale of our Mavely business,
                  compensation-related expenses associated with such sale, an unrealized investment loss, and restructuring and impairment charges.</div>
              </td>

  </tr>


