            <div><a href="#TABLEOFCONTENTS"><span style="font-style: italic; font-size: 8pt;">Table of Contents</span></a></div>

          </div>

        </div>

        <div>
          <div style="text-align: left; color: rgb(18, 115, 153); font-family: Arial; font-size: 12pt; font-weight: bold;"><a id="EXECUTIVECOMPENSATIONTABL"><!--Anchor--></a>EXECUTIVE COMPENSATION TABLES AND ACCOMPANYING NARRATIVE</div>

          <div>
            <hr style="background-color: #000000; border-bottom: medium none; border-left: medium none; border-right: medium none; border-top: medium none; margin: 0px auto; height: 1px; color: #000000; text-align: center; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;"/></div>

          <div style="text-align: left; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Arial; font-size: 10pt; font-weight: 400;"> <br/>
          </div>

          <div style="text-align: left; color: rgb(47, 84, 150); font-family: Arial; font-size: 12pt; font-weight: bold;"><a id="SummaryCompensationTable"><!--Anchor--></a>Summary Compensation Table</div>

          <div>&#160;</div>

          <div style="text-align: justify; color: rgb(101, 102, 106); font-family: Arial; font-size: 9pt;">The following table summarizes the total compensation of each of the NEOs for 2023, 2024 and 2025, as calculated in accordance with SEC rules. The
            amounts in the &#8220;Stock Awards&#8221; and &#8220;Option Awards&#8221; columns do not necessarily reflect the amounts actually earned by the NEOs because these amounts are calculated at the time of the grant, and they are not subsequently adjusted based on
            fluctuations in our stock price prior to vesting or the degree to which performance-based equity awards are ultimately earned or not earned based on company performance.</div>

          <div>&#160;</div>

          <table cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" border="0" style="font-family: Arial; font-size: 10pt; width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; text-align: left; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); border-spacing: 0;">


