    <td style="width: auto; vertical-align: top; text-align: justify;">
                  <div style="color: rgb(101, 102, 106); font-family: Arial; font-size: 9pt;">Executive and registrant contribution amounts are and have been reflected in the 2025 Summary Compensation Table and prior years&#8217; summary compensation tables, as
                    applicable. Aggregate earnings are not reflected in the 2025 Summary Compensation Table and were not reflected in prior years&#8217; summary compensation tables.</div>
