  <tr>

    <td style="width: 18pt; vertical-align: top; color: rgb(101, 102, 106); font-family: Arial; font-size: 9pt;">(2)</td>

    <td style="width: auto; vertical-align: top; text-align: justify;">
                    <div style="color: rgb(101, 102, 106); font-family: Arial; font-size: 9pt;">Excludes the impact of time-based and performance-based restricted stock units, which vest for no consideration. The weighted-average remaining life of the
                      options is 1.26 years.</div>
