<div style="text-align: justify; margin-left: 2.45pt; font-family: Arial; font-size: 10pt;"><span style="font-size: 10pt; font-family: Arial; font-style: italic; color: rgb(18, 115, 153);">Most Important Financial Performance Measures.</span><span style="font-size: 10pt; font-family: Arial; color: rgb(101, 102, 106);"> We believe the most important financial performance measures that are used to link the &#8220;compensation actually paid&#8221; to our NEOs to our 2025 performance are the
                following, with Adjusted EPS being the most important of these measures:</span></div>
</ix:nonNumeric>
