                    <div style="text-align: left; color: rgb(101, 102, 106); font-family: Arial; font-size: 10pt;"><ix:nonNumeric name="ecd:MeasureName" id="Fact_d8aa4e3d515948c1abfe2d335248009c" contextRef="c20250101to20251231_MeasureAxis_5Member">Adjusted Nu Skin selling expense percentage</ix:nonNumeric></div>
