                    <div style="color: rgb(101, 102, 106); font-family: Arial; font-size: 10pt;">Amend or modify any award or waive any restrictions or conditions applicable to any award or any shares acquired pursuant thereto;</div>
                  </td>

  </tr>


</table>
            <div>&#160;</div>

