                    <div style="color: rgb(101, 102, 106); font-family: Arial; font-size: 10pt;">Accelerate, continue or extend the exercisability or vesting of any award or any shares acquired pursuant thereto, including with respect to the period
                      following termination of a participant&#8217;s employment or services;</div>
                  </td>

  </tr>


</table>
            <div>&#160;</div>

            <table cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" class="DSPFListTable" style="font-family: Arial; font-size: 10pt; width: 100%; text-align: left; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); border-spacing: 0;">


