    <td style="width: auto; vertical-align: top; text-align: justify;">
                    <div style="color: rgb(101, 102, 106); font-family: Arial; font-size: 10pt;">Determine whether, and to what extent, awards may be settled in cash, shares, or other property, and whether such payment will be deferred either automatically
                      or the participant&#8217;s election;</div>
                  </td>

  </tr>


</table>
            <div>&#160;</div>

            <table cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" class="DSPFListTable" style="font-family: Arial; font-size: 10pt; width: 100%; text-align: left; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); border-spacing: 0;">


