                      <div style="color: rgb(101, 102, 106); font-family: Arial; font-size: 9pt;">Tax Fees for 2025 consist of approximately $737,600 in fees for tax compliance work and $1,242,000 in fees for tax consulting work. Tax Fees for 2024 consist
                        of approximately $610,500 in fees for tax compliance work and $563,600 in fees for tax consulting work.</div>
