                        Company securities beneficially owned by various Vanguard subsidiaries and/or business divisions. The Vanguard Group also reported that certain subsidiaries or business divisions that formerly had, or were deemed to have, beneficial
                        ownership with The Vanguard Group will report beneficial ownership separately (on a disaggregated basis).</div>
